  dialogueText: '"When someone asks you ''kumusta ka. '', you can tell them how you''re
    doing. In Ilokano, ''nasayaat ak'' means ''I''m fine'' or ''I''m doing well.
    ''

    For example, if someone asks how your journey is going, you can answer:
    ''Nasayaat ak.'
